%% MUPP-029 Single-kid wish list close motion
%% Opening and closing the list on a card with one kid.
flowchart TD
    A[Closed card, Önskelista button] -->|press| B[Button measured, list opens - R1]
    B --> C{Reduced motion?}
    C -- yes --> D[List in place at once - R3]
    C -- no --> E[growScale: list moved and scaled from the button box, fades in, 300 ms - R1 R2]
    E --> F[Open list, focus on Fäll ihop önskelistan]
    D --> F
    F -->|fold-up arrow or Esc| G[Ghost copy made, real list closed at once, button back with focus]
    G --> H{Reduced motion?}
    H -- yes --> I[No copy, closed at once - R3]
    H -- no --> J[shrinkTo: copy moved and scaled onto the button, fades, 300 ms - R1 R2]
    J --> K[Copy removed, nothing left]
    J -->|press Önskelista during the motion| L[Copy removed at once, list opens - R1]
    L --> E
